{"id":"bde936f2b3b58ee5","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-recursive-limit-approximation.md","title":"Recursive Limit Approximation","display":"df-recursive-limit-approximation — Recursive Limit Approximation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-recursive-limit-approximation","aliases":["68-df-recursive-limit-approximation"],"display":"df-recursive-limit-approximation — Recursive Limit Approximation","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 p.55 and limit lemma 15.4 p.56 / PDF 64-65","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-recursive-limit-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-recursive-limit-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-limit-approximation — Recursive Limit Approximation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 p.55 and limit lemma 15.4 p.56 / PDF 64-65"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\\)</span> 表示一列递归二值实数以逐点最终稳定的方式逼近集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Longrightarrow(g(s,x)=1\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Longrightarrow(g(s,x)=1\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在 p.55 定义递归实数序列及其极限，15.4 使用该定义。本节点采用集合的二值近似；顺序固定为阶段 s、输入 x。逐点最终稳定不是统一阶段稳定，也不要求逼近阶段对成员关系单调。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]。以下 $\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)$ 表示一列递归二值实数以逐点最终稳定的方式逼近集合 $A$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Longrightarrow(g(s,x)=1\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in A)).","display":true}],"bytes":1316,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce5ab33aceacb17e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation|df-recursive-limit-approximation — Recursive Limit Approximation]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3"]}